bove* the $x$-axis or *touches* this axis. We mark these values of $x$ in blue in the diagram below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972108/assets/f4b9cd7557301e663b226e155bef4603d552b1c866411bc687ab4a082efeeaf5.png)\n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $-5\\le x\\le 1.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186276403 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fc419917-fe34-5bf9-8bf0-1b022fce11ff" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a \"Less Than\" Inequality Given the Graph of the Corresponding Parabola"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2fc622ab-ec8b-56f2-af37-095411e63ba5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276405}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2fc622ab-ec8b-56f2-af37-095411e63ba5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276405} :answer-field/id #uuid "fca792aa-c97b-5165-8283-d50273458313" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276404} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29c2fa83-40b9-5825-84ad-b37b6c819982" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "<" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276407}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "29c2fa83-40b9-5825-84ad-b37b6c819982" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "<" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276407} :answer-field/id #uuid "b8f30203-4a50-5780-82b3-41853d6d04cc" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276406} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a3143dba-5194-551d-af72-f22554999906" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276409}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a3143dba-5194-551d-af72-f22554999906" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276409} :answer-f