ches* this axis. We mark these values of $x$ in blue in the diagram below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972108/assets/aa1e361d53401bff39f4c53a2282d7b496ad9b46c586badc279265b2638ee73e.png)\n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $x\\le -4$ or $x\\ge 2.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186276418 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "36d4bf37-4818-58ac-9e39-75ce8ceef06a" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a \"Less Than or Equal To\" Inequality Given the Graph of the Corresponding Parabola"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "58b02d21-5b26-5afa-9851-8ebf7e6edb67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276420} {:answer/id #uuid "ed535c62-cebd-581a-8cee-87fc90d45424" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276421}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "58b02d21-5b26-5afa-9851-8ebf7e6edb67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276420} :answer-field/id #uuid "a6908579-54cf-52c7-b417-12a68efdf442" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276419} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "70ed5b51-5abe-5ac7-9f8c-41f86c9a3638" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276423}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "70ed5b51-5abe-5ac7-9f8c-41f86c9a3638" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276423} :answer-field/id #uuid "e74b83ee-62ca-5cb6-8bb8-3b5fa8910249" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276422} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "50c2fb57-16eb-5a7a-a756-f7c8b0ce06f7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276425}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/